    "explanation": "Both parties: the SGD 4.50 no-show cancellation fee charged on trip TRP-02748 is refunded in FULL to the rider, and no driver compensation is payable. The charge cannot stand under POL-NS-01, the anchor clause, which requires all four of its limbs. Limb (d) requires the trip to have been terminated with cancellation_reason_code RIDER_NO_SHOW, RIDER_UNREACHABLE or EXCESSIVE_WAIT, and it expressly excludes DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE. The trip record (EV-TRIP-02748) records exactly that code, and the driver has properly conceded the point. The other limbs do hold: the GPS trace (EV-GPS-02748) places the driver inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius at the pickup pin for a continuous run of 200 seconds (19:11:48-19:15:08) with 21 qualifying fixes, which exceeds the 180-second free waiting period in force (trip_record.platform_policy.free_wait_sec). Because the driver's stationary fixes were INSIDE the arrival radius and the reason code was DRIVER_UNABLE_TO_LOCATE, POL-NS-01 directs a full refund of the cancellation fee with no driver compensation and a driver-education referral for the mis-selected code. The rider would in any event be exonerated under POL-NS-04: he sent a locating message ('at the lift lobby', EV-CHAT-02748, 19:12:48) inside the waiting window; the driver neither replied within 120 seconds of it nor placed any in-app voice call (trip_record.in_app_calls is empty); and the rider's own track (EV-GPS-02748) places his device 12.5-19.7 m from the pin, well inside the 100 m STANDARD rider-presence radius, across 40 qualifying fixes. Claims addressed: the driver's claim that compensation of SGD 3.60 (80 percent of the SGD 4.50 fee) is payable and the ruling should be NO_ACTION is rejected - POL-NS-07 compensates only where POL-NS-01 is satisfied in full, which it is not, so there is no standing fee to share out. The anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d is 1 against completed_trips_30d 137, a rate of 0.007, EV-DPROF-02748), but that is not what defeats the compensation; limb (d) is. The rider's POL-NS-06 shortfall claim is rejected: it compares the 200-second dwell against fee_schedule.minimum_dwell_sec of 300 s for STANDARD, and the fee_schedule resolution rule states that figure is retained only for records authored before policy version 2 and is never applied to a record carrying platform_policy; the free waiting period in force is 180 s and the 200-second dwell exceeds it. POL-NS-03 is not engaged, because the driver was inside the arrival radius and not in the 50-400 m wrong-entrance band, so no pin-ambiguity goodwill arises and neither party gets to re-route the fee to it. Weight and escalation: the GPS trace and the trip record are both COMPLETE at weight_multiplier 1.0 with 100 percent coverage and no gaps, and the counterparty statement (DRIVER, 2026-09-19) independently records the driver's inability to locate the rider, so the deciding facts rest on unimpaired evidence; the MISSING traffic advisory (EV-ADVIS-02748-01, weight 0.0) carries no deciding fact in this case. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires - confidence is above the 0.70 floor, the artifacts do not contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence, the profile counters show no repeat dispute between these parties, and no anti-farming pattern is present. The monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold and the charge (currently CHARGED, refund_issued_sgd 0.00, EV-FARE-02748) is to be refunded in full. This is a provisional ruling; either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04."
  },
